  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Crafting AI Insights**\n\nI\'m focusing intently on building the `AIInsightsView.tsx`. The goal is meticulous craftsmanship, emphasizing Zero-Waste Recipes and Chef IA. I\'m working on the title now: \"Chef IA & Recetas de Rescate\", and including model/AI badges. \"N\" will be removed.\n\n\n**Designing Recipe UI**\n\nI\'ve been iterating on the UI, concentrating on an \"Nuevas Recetas IA\" button with animation, which I believe will improve user engagement. I\'m also now planning the Food Safety Warning Banner, with high contrast text in Spanish. I am thinking it should say something along the lines of \"Seguridad Sanitaria: Se han excluido autom\303\241ticamente X producto(s) caducados de tu despensa para proteger tu salud. Te recomendamos desecharlos o compostarlos.\". I have also been working on pantry rescue overview.\n\n\n"
