    thinking: "**Considering Dashboard Enhancements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the dashboard\'s design. I\'ve noted the existing edit functionality within `DashboardView` and the associated modal. My attention is shifting to the user experience. I\'m exploring adding a direct delete option to each card, either as a button or through an action menu.\n\n\n**Refining Delete Implementation**\n\nI\'m now focused on the deletion process. I\'ve realized why the existing \"Eliminar\" button wasn\'t functioning correctly \342\200\223 the native `confirm()` function is often blocked within the iframe environment. To address this, I\'m designing a custom inline confirmation modal. My current plan is to add a distinct delete icon button (likely a trash icon) next to the edit icon on the dashboard\'s product card.\n\n\n"
