    thinking: "**Analyzing the UI Design**\n\nOkay, I\'m breaking down the interface. The \"Recetas Zero-Waste del Chef IA\" banner is clearly the title. \"Cocinar con lo que tengo,\" \"Regenerar,\" and \"Pantry Stats\" seem to be prominent features. The food safety notice emphasizes no expired ingredients. The \"Custom Recipe Request\" box is also important, it looks like a prominent element for users.\n\n\n**Refining the Interface Layout**\n\nI\'m removing the live chat element based on the feedback; it\'s gone from the UI entirely. I\'ve eliminated the associated chat-related state, handlers, and imports within `AIInsightsView.tsx`. Now, I am concentrating on the remaining features of the design, working on refining the recipe card grid and details modal, the meal category filter tabs. I am making sure the layout feels intuitive.\n\n\n"
