          text: "   - **Prueba de frescura en agua**: Coloca el huevo en un vaso con agua. Si se hunde en el fondo horizontal, es muy fresco. Si se pone de pie, cons\303\272melo pronto. Si flota, des\303\251chalo."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Claras sobrantes: Cong\303\251lalas en bandejas de hielo para merengues o tortillas."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Carnes y Aves**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Divide en porciones individuales y congela en paquetes planos para descongelar de forma uniforme y r\303\241pida en la nevera."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - **Marinado previo**: Congelar carne en marinadas con aceite y hierbas retiene humedad y sabor."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Pescados**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Cocina los pescados frescos en 24\342\200\22348 horas o prep\303\241ralos en escabeche suave para extender su conservaci\303\263n 4-5 d\303\255as en la nevera.`;"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "    } else {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "      return `### \360\237\215\227 Safe Protein Storage & Freezing Guidelines:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **The Egg Float Test**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Sink flat: Super fresh. Stands upright: Eat soon. Floats to the top: Discard immediately."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Leftover whites: Freeze in ice cube trays for baking."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Meats & Poultry**:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Portion into flat, airtight freezer packs for faster, even thawing."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "   - Freeze in marinades (oil, herbs, citrus) to lock in juiciness.`;"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "    }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "  }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "  // 6. Generic / Pantry Inventory Contextual Response"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "  if (isSpanish) {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "    return `### \360\237\221\250\342\200\215\360\237\215\263 Consejos del Chef Zero-Waste:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "\302\241Excelente consulta! Para optimizar los ingredientes de tu despensa (${validNames || \'ingredientes frescos\'}):"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **Organizaci\303\263n FIFO (Primero en Entrar, Primero en Salir)**: Coloca siempre al frente de tus estantes y refrigerador los productos con fecha m\303\241s pr\303\263xima."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Control de Humedad**: Envu\303\251lvelos en papel absorbente dentro de recipientes herm\303\251ticos para evitar condensaci\303\263n."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Planificaci\303\263n de Men\303\272s**: Cocina primero los productos con menos de 5 d\303\255as de margen combin\303\241ndolos en salteados, sopas cremosas, tortillas o boles nutritivos."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "\302\277Te gustar\303\255a que dise\303\261emos una receta espec\303\255fica para alguno de tus ingredientes?`;"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "  } else {"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "    return `### \360\237\221\250\342\200\215\360\237\215\263 Zero-Waste Chef Tips:"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "Great question! To get the most out of your kitchen staples (${validNames || \'fresh ingredients\'}):"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "1. **FIFO Method (First-In, First-Out)**: Place near-expiry items at the front of your shelves and crisper drawers."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "2. **Moisture Control**: Line storage containers with paper towels to absorb excess condensation."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "3. **Rescue Cooking**: Prioritize items with under 5 days remaining by blending them into creamy soups, frittatas, or stir-fries."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "Would you like a tailored recipe for any of your specific ingredients?`;"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "  }"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
      }
    }
  }
